  "post_content": "<p>]<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ExpoBeatrizMartinezMariaLlidoSuera.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(58 fotos) Mentre diumenge s&#39;ha visitat l&#39;exposici&oacute; de quadres i escultures &ldquo;Mecanismes i estructures del desig&rdquo;, de B&agrave;rbara Mart&iacute;nez Blot i Maria Llid&oacute; Vicent, aquest dimarts festiu s&#39;ha naugurat la mostra de pintura d&#39;Alberto Rossell&oacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PaellesSuera.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Dilluns de nit es va fer el concorregut concurs de paelles a l&#39;explanada de la Font Seca.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1693.jpg\" alt=\"img_1693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1694.jpg\" alt=\"img_1694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1695.jpg\" alt=\"img_1695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1697.jpg\" alt=\"img_1697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1698.jpg\" alt=\"img_1698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1700.jpg\" alt=\"img_1700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelles/img_1701.jpg\" alt=\"img_1701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suera17expoipaelle